# ===============================================================
# OmniAI Full-Stack Production Environment Variables (Overview)
# ===============================================================
#
# For Vercel (Frontend):
#   Set these in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables:
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=wss://your-backend.onrender.com/api/voice/grak-speak
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_ENV=production
#   (Plus Firebase variables if using Google login)
#
# For Render (Backend):
#   Set these in Render Web Service -> Environment Variables:
#
#   DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://user:pass@host:5432/dbname (or leave default sqlite:///./test.db)
#   ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-app.vercel.app
#   CORS_ORIGIN_REGEX=https://.*\.vercel\.app
#   JWT_SECRET_KEY=your_secure_random_key_here
#   GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key
#   GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_key
#   DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=your_deepgram_key
#   NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-your_nvidia_key
#   BREVO_API_KEY=your_brevo_key
#   BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL=your_verified_sender_email
# ===============================================================
